    :oracleText """Vigilance
Converge — When this creature enters, you may draw X cards, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell. If you draw one or more cards this way, discard two cards."""@en ;
    :flavorText """Even as most archaics raged across Arcavios, others seemed to sink into contemplation."""@en ;
