    :oracleText """Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. It gains vigilance until end of turn.
Flashback {W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)"""@en ;
    :flavorText """"I checked my pack twice before we left campus. So why do I feel like I forgot something?\""""@en ;
